    {
      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/cat-harness/0.1.0/ns#glossary/platform/associated-harness",
      "@type": "skos:Concept",
      "skos:inScheme": {
        "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/cat-harness/0.1.0/ns#glossary/platform"
      },
      "skos:prefLabel": [
        {
          "@value": "associated harness",
          "@language": "en"
        },
        {
          "@value": "إطار مرتبط",
          "@language": "ar"
        },
        {
          "@value": "arnés asociado",
          "@language": "es"
        },
        {
          "@value": "harnais associé",
          "@language": "fr"
        },
        {
          "@value": "связанная обвязка",
          "@language": "ru"
        },
        {
          "@value": "关联框架",
          "@language": "zh"
        }
      ],
      "skos:definition": [
        {
          "@value": "A harness this one knows by name, site and repository, and never loads, builds or copies. The fourth relation beside depends (needs), references (remoteGraphs) and utilizes (dependencies).",
          "@language": "en"
        },
        {
          "@value": "إطار يعرفه هذا الإطار باسمه وموقعه ومستودعه، ولا يحمّله ولا يبنيه ولا ينسخه أبداً. وهو العلاقة الرابعة إلى جانب «يعتمد على» (needs) و«يشير إلى» (remoteGraphs) و«يستخدم» (dependencies).",
          "@language": "ar"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Un arnés que este conoce por nombre, sitio y repositorio, y que nunca carga, construye ni copia. La cuarta relación junto a depende (needs), referencia (remoteGraphs) y utiliza (dependencies).",
          "@language": "es"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Un harnais que celui-ci connaît par son nom, son site et son dépôt, et qu'il ne charge, ne construit ni ne copie jamais. La quatrième relation à côté de dépend (needs), référence (remoteGraphs) et utilise (dependencies).",
          "@language": "fr"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Обвязка, которую данная знает по имени, сайту и репозиторию и никогда не загружает, не собирает и не копирует. Четвёртое отношение наряду с «зависит» (needs), «ссылается» (remoteGraphs) и «использует» (dependencies).",
          "@language": "ru"
        },
        {
          "@value": "本框架按名称、站点和仓库知晓、但从不加载、构建或复制的另一个框架。这是依赖（needs）、引用（remoteGraphs）和使用（dependencies）之外的第四种关系。",
          "@language": "zh"
        }
      ],
      "dcterms:source": "cat-harness/schemas/cat-harness.ts#AssociatedHarness"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/cat-harness/0.1.0/ns#glossary/platform/policy",
      "@type": "skos:Concept",
      "skos:inScheme": {
        "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/cat-harness/0.1.0/ns#glossary/platform"
      },
      "skos:prefLabel": [
        {
          "@value": "policy",
          "@language": "en"
        },
        {
          "@value": "سياسة",
          "@language": "ar"
        },
        {
          "@value": "política",
          "@language": "es"
        },
        {
          "@value": "politique",
          "@language": "fr"
        },
        {
          "@value": "политика",
          "@language": "ru"
        },
        {
          "@value": "策略",
          "@language": "zh"
        }
      ],
      "skos:definition": [
        {
          "@value": "Which Actor may do which action, and where, written as W3C ODRL 2.2 permission and prohibition rules scoped by Process, Task and Role.",
          "@language": "en"
        },
        {
          "@value": "أيّ فاعل يجوز له أيّ إجراء وأين، مكتوباً في صورة قواعد إذن وحظر وفق W3C ODRL 2.2 محدّدة النطاق بالعملية والمهمة والدور.",
          "@language": "ar"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Qué Actor puede realizar qué acción, y dónde, escrito como reglas de permiso y prohibición de W3C ODRL 2.2 acotadas por Proceso, Tarea y Rol.",
          "@language": "es"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Quel Acteur peut effectuer quelle action, et où, écrit sous forme de règles de permission et d'interdiction W3C ODRL 2.2 délimitées par Processus, Tâche et Rôle.",
          "@language": "fr"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Какой Актор может выполнять какое действие и где — в виде правил разрешения и запрета W3C ODRL 2.2, ограниченных Процессом, Задачей и Ролью.",
          "@language": "ru"
        },
        {
          "@value": "哪个行动者可以在何处执行哪项操作，以按流程、任务和角色限定范围的 W3C ODRL 2.2 许可与禁止规则表述。",
          "@language": "zh"
        }
      ],
      "skos:exactMatch": [
        {
          "@id": "http://www.w3.org/ns/odrl/2/Policy"
        }
      ],
      "dcterms:source": "cat-harness/schemas/odrl.ts"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/cat-harness/0.1.0/ns#glossary/platform/permission",
      "@type": "skos:Concept",
      "skos:inScheme": {
        "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/cat-harness/0.1.0/ns#glossary/platform"
      },
      "skos:prefLabel": [
        {
          "@value": "permission",
          "@language": "en"
        },
        {
          "@value": "إذن",
          "@language": "ar"
        },
        {
          "@value": "permiso",
          "@language": "es"
        },
        {
          "@value": "permission",
          "@language": "fr"
        },
        {
          "@value": "разрешение",
          "@language": "ru"
        },
        {
          "@value": "许可",
          "@language": "zh"
        }
      ],
      "skos:definition": [
        {
          "@value": "One ODRL rule allowing an assignee an action, optionally on a target and within constraints. A permission to a broader action permits every action included in it.",
          "@language": "en"
        },
        {
          "@value": "قاعدة ODRL واحدة تتيح لمُسنَد إليه إجراءً، اختيارياً على هدف وضمن قيود. والإذن بإجراء أوسع يتيح كل إجراء يندرج تحته.",
          "@language": "ar"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Una regla ODRL que permite a un destinatario una acción, opcionalmente sobre un objetivo y dentro de unas restricciones. Un permiso para una acción más amplia permite todas las acciones incluidas en ella.",
          "@language": "es"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Une règle ODRL qui autorise une action à un bénéficiaire, éventuellement sur une cible et dans certaines contraintes. Une permission portant sur une action plus large autorise toutes les actions qu'elle inclut.",
          "@language": "fr"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Одно правило ODRL, разрешающее получателю действие, при необходимости над объектом и в определённых ограничениях. Разрешение на более широкое действие разрешает и все входящие в него действия.",
          "@language": "ru"
        },
        {
          "@value": "一条 ODRL 规则，允许某一受让方执行某一操作，可选地限定目标并附带约束。对较宽泛操作的许可，同时许可其中包含的所有操作。",
          "@language": "zh"
        }
      ],
      "skos:broader": [
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/cat-harness/0.1.0/ns#glossary/platform/policy"
        }
      ],
      "skos:exactMatch": [
        {
          "@id": "http://www.w3.org/ns/odrl/2/Permission"
        }
      ],
      "dcterms:source": "cat-harness/schemas/odrl.ts"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/cat-harness/0.1.0/ns#glossary/platform/task-run",
      "@type": "skos:Concept",
      "skos:inScheme": {
        "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/cat-harness/0.1.0/ns#glossary/platform"
      },
      "skos:prefLabel": [
        {
          "@value": "task run",
          "@language": "en"
        },
        {
          "@value": "تنفيذ المهمة",
          "@language": "ar"
        },
        {
          "@value": "ejecución de tarea",
          "@language": "es"
        },
        {
          "@value": "exécution de tâche",
          "@language": "fr"
        },
        {
          "@value": "выполнение задачи",
          "@language": "ru"
        },
        {
          "@value": "任务执行",
          "@language": "zh"
        }
      ],
      "skos:definition": [
        {
          "@value": "One performance of a BPMN task by an Actor in a Role under a policy, recorded as a W3C PROV-O activity whose plan is the task.",
          "@language": "en"
        },
        {
          "@value": "تنفيذ واحد لمهمة BPMN يقوم به فاعل في دور وفق سياسة، يُسجَّل نشاطاً وفق W3C PROV-O خطّتُه هي المهمة.",
          "@language": "ar"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Una ejecución de una tarea BPMN por un Actor en un Rol bajo una política, registrada como una actividad W3C PROV-O cuyo plan es la tarea.",
          "@language": "es"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Une exécution d'une tâche BPMN par un Acteur dans un Rôle sous une politique, enregistrée comme une activité W3C PROV-O dont le plan est la tâche.",
          "@language": "fr"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Одно выполнение задачи BPMN Актором в Роли в рамках политики, записанное как действие W3C PROV-O, планом которого является задача.",
          "@language": "ru"
        },
        {
          "@value": "行动者以某一角色、在某一策略下对 BPMN 任务的一次执行，记录为以该任务为计划的 W3C PROV-O 活动。",
          "@language": "zh"
        }
      ],
      "skos:closeMatch": [
        {
          "@id": "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Activity"
        }
      ],
      "dcterms:source": "cat-harness/schemas/prov.ts"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/cat-harness/0.1.0/ns#glossary/platform/actor",
      "@type": "skos:Concept",
      "skos:inScheme": {
        "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/cat-harness/0.1.0/ns#glossary/platform"
      },
      "skos:prefLabel": [
        {
          "@value": "actor",
          "@language": "en"
        },
        {
          "@value": "فاعل",
          "@language": "ar"
        },
        {
          "@value": "actor",
          "@language": "es"
        },
        {
          "@value": "acteur",
          "@language": "fr"
        },
        {
          "@value": "актор",
          "@language": "ru"
        },
        {
          "@value": "行动者",
          "@language": "zh"
        }
      ],
      "skos:definition": [
        {
          "@value": "A concrete participant, human, agentic or mechanical, that persists across every process and takes on roles. Which login is which actor is the data store's to know.",
          "@language": "en"
        },
        {
          "@value": "مشارك محدّد، بشري أو وكيل ذكي أو آلي، يستمر عبر كل العمليات ويتولّى أدواراً. أما أيّ حساب دخول يقابل أيّ فاعل فذلك من شأن مخزن البيانات.",
          "@language": "ar"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Un participante concreto, humano, agéntico o mecánico, que persiste a través de todos los procesos y asume roles. Qué inicio de sesión corresponde a qué actor es algo que sabe el almacén de datos.",
          "@language": "es"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Un participant concret, humain, agentique ou mécanique, qui persiste à travers tous les processus et endosse des rôles. Quel identifiant correspond à quel acteur, c'est au magasin de données de le savoir.",
          "@language": "fr"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Конкретный участник — человек, агент или механизм, — существующий во всех процессах и принимающий на себя роли. Какая учётная запись какому актору соответствует, известно хранилищу данных.",
          "@language": "ru"
        },
        {
          "@value": "一个具体的参与者，可以是人、智能体或机械程序，贯穿所有流程并担任角色。哪个登录名对应哪个行动者，由数据存储负责掌握。",
          "@language": "zh"
        }
      ],
      "skos:closeMatch": [
        {
          "@id": "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Agent"
        }
      ],
      "dcterms:source": "cat-harness/skills/process/process-core/role-model.md"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/cat-harness/0.1.0/ns#glossary/platform/role",
      "@type": "skos:Concept",
      "skos:inScheme": {
        "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/cat-harness/0.1.0/ns#glossary/platform"
      },
      "skos:prefLabel": [
        {
          "@value": "role",
          "@language": "en"
        },
        {
          "@value": "دور",
          "@language": "ar"
        },
        {
          "@value": "rol",
          "@language": "es"
        },
        {
          "@value": "rôle",
          "@language": "fr"
        },
        {
          "@value": "роль",
          "@language": "ru"
        },
        {
          "@value": "角色",
          "@language": "zh"
        }
      ],
      "skos:definition": [
        {
          "@value": "The swimlane: a persona an actor takes on because of the lane it is acting in, carrying the skills that lane's activities need.",
          "@language": "en"
        },
        {
          "@value": "المسار: شخصية يتقمّصها الفاعل بحكم المسار الذي يعمل فيه، وتحمل المهارات التي تحتاجها أنشطة ذلك المسار.",
          "@language": "ar"
        },
        {
          "@value": "El carril: una persona que un actor asume por el carril en el que actúa, y que lleva las habilidades que necesitan las actividades de ese carril.",
          "@language": "es"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Le couloir : un personnage qu'un acteur endosse en raison du couloir dans lequel il agit, porteur des compétences dont les activités de ce couloir ont besoin.",
          "@language": "fr"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Дорожка: образ, который актор принимает на себя из-за дорожки, в которой действует, и который несёт навыки, нужные действиям этой дорожки.",
          "@language": "ru"
        },
        {
          "@value": "泳道：行动者因其所在泳道而担任的角色形象，承载该泳道中各活动所需的技能。",
          "@language": "zh"
        }
      ],
      "skos:related": [
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/cat-harness/0.1.0/ns#glossary/platform/actor"
        }
      ],
      "skos:closeMatch": [
        {
          "@id": "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Role"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/folio/library/who-dpi-h-reference-architecture-draft-v1/sections/sec-048"
        },
        {
          "@id": "http://smart.who.int/base/StructureDefinition/GenericPersona"
        }
      ],
      "dcterms:source": "cat-harness/skills/process/process-core/role-model.md"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/cat-harness/0.1.0/ns#glossary/platform/user-story",
      "@type": "skos:Concept",
      "skos:inScheme": {
        "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/cat-harness/0.1.0/ns#glossary/platform"
      },
      "skos:prefLabel": [
        {
          "@value": "user story"
        }
      ],
      "skos:definition": [
        {
          "@value": "What a reader acting in a Role is trying to do, told as that role: as a <role>, I want <want>, so that <so that>. The story points at its role; the role names no story."
        }
      ],
      "skos:closeMatch": [
        {
          "@id": "http://smart.who.int/base/StructureDefinition/SGUserStory"
        }
      ],
      "dcterms:source": "cat-harness/schemas/user-story.ts"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/cat-harness/0.1.0/ns#glossary/platform/test-run",
      "@type": "skos:Concept",
      "skos:inScheme": {
        "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/cat-harness/0.1.0/ns#glossary/platform"
      },
      "skos:prefLabel": [
        {
          "@value": "test run"
        }
      ],
      "skos:definition": [
        {
          "@value": "One measurement of a Skill: which skill it tests, the cases it exercised, and a hash of the data and a hash of the process that produced the result, so a third party can redo it. Its cases are checked against the skill's input and output contracts."
        }
      ],
      "dcterms:source": "cat-harness/schemas/test-run.ts"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/cat-harness/0.1.0/ns#glossary/platform/voice",
      "@type": "skos:Concept",
      "skos:inScheme": {
        "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/cat-harness/0.1.0/ns#glossary/platform"
      },
      "skos:prefLabel": [
        {
          "@value": "voice"
        }
      ],
      "skos:definition": [
        {
          "@value": "A named set of writing rules for prose, active in the roles and processes it names. The voice points at the role it is written for; the role names no voice."
        }
      ],
      "dcterms:source": "cat-harness/schemas/voices.ts"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/cat-harness/0.1.0/ns#glossary/platform/external-schema",
      "@type": "skos:Concept",
      "skos:inScheme": {
        "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/cat-harness/0.1.0/ns#glossary/platform"
      },
      "skos:prefLabel": [
        {
          "@value": "external schema"
        }
      ],
      "skos:definition": [
        {
          "@value": "A record of a specification the platform depends on but does not hold: which authority publishes it, which version is conformed to, and the operative terms used from it."
        }
      ],
      "dcterms:source": "cat-harness/schemas/external-schema.ts"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/cat-harness/0.1.0/ns#glossary/platform/kg-qa-report",
      "@type": "skos:Concept",
      "skos:inScheme": {
        "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/cat-harness/0.1.0/ns#glossary/platform"
      },
      "skos:prefLabel": [
        {
          "@value": "KG QA report"
        }
      ],
      "skos:definition": [
        {
          "@value": "A committed QA sidecar recording, for one knowledge-graph subject such as a process, role or skill, which of its references fail to resolve under each audit criterion."
        }
      ],
      "dcterms:source": "cat-harness/schemas/kg-qa.ts"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/cat-harness/0.1.0/ns#glossary/platform/todo",
      "@type": "skos:Concept",
      "skos:inScheme": {
        "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/cat-harness/0.1.0/ns#glossary/platform"
      },
      "skos:prefLabel": [
        {
          "@value": "todo"
        }
      ],
      "skos:definition": [
        {
          "@value": "One person's outstanding work, as a content node the folio owns, tagged with the roles, processes and tasks it concerns. Not the agent work plan, which is beans."
        }
      ],
      "dcterms:source": "cat-harness/schemas/todo.ts"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/cat-harness/0.1.0/ns#glossary/platform/bean",
      "@type": "skos:Concept",
      "skos:inScheme": {
        "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/cat-harness/0.1.0/ns#glossary/platform"
      },
      "skos:prefLabel": [
        {
          "@value": "bean"
        }
      ],
      "skos:definition": [
        {
          "@value": "One item of the agent work plan, held by the beans CLI in the committed beans/ store, with a status, a parent and the beans it blocks."
        }
      ],
      "rdfs:isDefinedBy": {
        "@id": "https://github.com/hmans/beans"
      },
      "dcterms:source": "cat-harness/skills/sdlc/sdlc-core/todo-manager.md"
    },
